{"id":"n79742-1-7","stage":5,"title":"타이르다 · 劝导","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79742-1-7-1","ko":"우리 얘가 또 싸움을 했단 말이야? 도대체 뭐가 문제래?","zh":"我们家孩子又打架了？到底是什么问题啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘가","meaning":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"얘：“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67258","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸움을","meaning":"争斗，打架，战斗","explanation":"싸움：争斗，打架，战斗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"싸움","audio":"/audio/4239ef3beaa33c340c05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24286","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했단","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야?","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도대체","meaning":"到底，究竟","explanation":"도대체：到底，究竟","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"3","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제래?","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"1ad358ceb1fa5d83","term":"얘","zh":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3","entryId":"67258","definition":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"4239ef3beaa33c34","term":"싸움","zh":"争斗，打架，战斗","audio":"/audio/4239ef3beaa33c340c05.mp3","entryId":"24286","definition":"为了战胜对方，凭借口舌、力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸움"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"5961e5da228541d4","term":"도대체","zh":"到底，究竟","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3","entryId":"14385","definition":"非常好奇而问的话。","pronunciation":["도대체"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/dffe876bbd32e35eb52c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79742-1-7-2","ko":"그러게요. 당신이 잘 타일러 보세요.","zh":"是啊。您最好去好好劝劝他吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당신이","meaning":"您","explanation":"당신：您；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"5","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타일러","meaning":"劝导，开导，劝诫，劝说","explanation":"타이르다：劝导，开导，劝诫，劝说；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"타이르다","audio":"/audio/e95b41901c66186c67b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79742","senseId":"1","lemma":"타이르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"您","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(敬语)指代听话人。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e95b41901c66186c","term":"타이르다","zh":"劝导，开导，劝诫，劝说","audio":"/audio/e95b41901c66186c67b1.mp3","entryId":"79742","definition":"为让人听懂而亲切、有条理地说。","pronunciation":["타이르다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/48e90f68df2184d19872.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.474,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79742","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.3007,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊。您最好去好好劝劝他吧。","丢失的钱包里的钱不都是丢了吗？","我们家孩子又打架了？到底是什么问题啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊。您最好去好好劝劝他吧。","我们家孩子又打架了？到底是什么问题啊？","丢失的钱包里的钱不都是丢了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
